      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me put together a timeline for the opening ceremony of a medical symposium in geneva? its a 3 day thing but i just need the schedule for the first morning. i need to account for the keynote speaker arriving, av/mic testing, catering setup for coffee, and the actual start of the welcome remarks. can u make it pretty detailed?",
